        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Winstone\n- Products: The Magic Roundabout, Cold Mountain, Nil By Mouth, King Arthur, The Departed, Beowulf, Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull, Edge of Darkness, The Sweeney, Noah, Doogal, The Lord of the Springs, Pollux - Le manège enchanté\n- Topics: filmography, film releases, alternate titles, computer-animated fantasy films, television adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- Ray Winstone has appeared in films including Cold Mountain, Nil By Mouth, King Arthur, The Magic Roundabout, The Departed, Beowulf, Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull, Edge of Darkness, The Sweeney, and Noah.\n- The Magic Roundabout is a 2005 French-British computer-animated adventure fantasy film.\n- The Magic Roundabout is based on the television series The Magic Roundabout.\n- The Magic Roundabout was released in France as Pollux - Le manège enchanté.\n- The Magic Roundabout was redubbed in the United States as Doogal or The Lord of the Springs.",
